---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../../../styles/catalog.css';
import '../../../styles/prose.css';
---

<Base title="MAP 0.1 archive" theme="light">
  <main id="main" class="container">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-line">Historical material</span>
      <h1>MAP 0.1 archive</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        MAP 0.1 is superseded. Its published files remain available to interpret older messages.
        <a href="/archive/map-0.2">MAP 0.2</a> followed it; <a href="/specification">MAP 0.3</a>
        is the current working draft for new implementations.
      </p>
    </header>
    <article class="prose">
      <h2>Published profile</h2>
      <p>
        These files retain their original bytes. The archive status does not alter the profile
        record or an old message's meaning.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/profiles/map/0.1.json">Profile record</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contexts/map-0.1.jsonld">JSON-LD context</a></li>
        <li><a href="/schemas/map-0.1.schema.json">Core schema</a></li>
        <li><a href="/schemas/type-contract-0.1.schema.json">Type contract format</a></li>
        <li><a href="/schemas/forms-0.1.schema.json">Form schema</a></li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/mailschema/mailschema/blob/dd079bc/conformance/map-0.1/manifest.json">
            Conformance manifest
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/mailschema/mailschema/blob/dd079bc/docs/specification/profile.md">
            Historical specification source
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Content Review</h2>
      <p>
        Content Review 0.1 was superseded by 0.2. Both contracts and their schemas remain
        available. Content Review 0.2 has no direct successor in MAP 0.3: campaign sending and
        publication have distinct effects and require their own explicit decisions.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="/contracts/content-review-0.1.json">Content Review 0.1</a>
          {' · '}
          <a href="/schemas/content-review-0.1.schema.json">Schema</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/contracts/content-review-0.2.json">Content Review 0.2</a>
          {' · '}
          <a href="/schemas/content-review-0.2.schema.json">Schema</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
